  `nebula_list_cross_references`, `nebula_list_evidence_links`
- REST fallback on :3101 (`/api/agent-records`, `/api/harvest-candidates`,
  `/api/open-questions`)

### Knowledge-mcp (knowledge-srv port 3109)
- Read-only knowledge graph access (stdio MCP server, global opencode
  config; namespaced `knowledge-mcp_*` in opencode)
- Tools: `knowledge_list_entities`, `knowledge_get_entity`,
  `knowledge_list_edges`, `knowledge_get_entity_relations`,
  `knowledge_list_cross_references`, `knowledge_list_migrations`,
  `knowledge_graph_summary`, `knowledge_semantic_search`
- Semantic search covers 4 embed layers (kg / harvest / observation /
  agent) via pgvector + Ollama (nomic-embed-text)
- See `knowledge-mcp-tools` and `investigation-resources` cards for usage

### Chat Server (port 3101)
- Python: nexus/python/conduit/agent_chat.py
- MCP server proxies /chat routes:
  - GET /chat/config — available agent roles
  - POST /chat/send — send message to an agent
  - GET /chat/sessions — active sessions
- Supports @planner, @builder, @reviewer, @critic notation
- Spawns opencode run --agent <role> as background process
- Streams output via SSE: /chat/stream/<id>

### Health Check
- GET /health returns server status, PID, pipeline state
- OrphanScan section: detects soft-deleted plans with stale .md files, and filesystem artifacts with no DB row
