  ('95f4d50c-d05b-4284-bfec-94355f341ec8', 'tackle-mcp-tools', 'Tackle-MCP Tool Reference', 'Complete catalog of tackle-mcp tools for AI config and memory management.', '## Tackle-MCP Tool Reference

